# Every text file is checked out with LF on every system, since the fourth
# addendum of 14 October 2026 to the roadmap entry on the command reader:
# the hooks, the programs under bin/ and scripts/ and the files they read are
# run by bash and awk, which read a CR as part of a line, and Git for Windows
# sets core.autocrlf=true by default, the GitHub Windows runner installs it
# with that default. text=auto lets git tell a binary file from a text file.
* text=auto eol=lf
